// Hand-written 6-1 content: entities (objection pads, contempt gavels and their shockwave), the honey-wood courtroom (theme, props, lighting),
// the narrator lines and the level script. design/levels/level_6_1.py appends this file to the generated data. Courtroom slapstick only.
